From: Philipp Gerbach <gerbach@fs-net.de>
Date: Tue, 13 May 2025 16:53:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 07/11] Add support for the EE0350ET F&S MIPI display

Move display intitalisation to enable function, because the DSI bridge
is not initialized when the display prepare is called.
